  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Foremost in the ungermaw’s arsenal is their powerful bite. At 1st level, the ungermaw gains a bite attack appropriate to their size (1d6 for a medium creature, 1d4 for a small creature). This is a primary natural attack, or a secondary attack if he attacks with a manufactured weapon. If he already has a bite attack, either from his race or from a previous class, the damage from his bite increases by one size.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ungermaw#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
